                    {
                        "translation_id": "b6627b30-8132-412a-bf43-be1d15becb08",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd70e765-4815-326f-a164-b2dd5c58e39d",
                        "target_lang_word": "Guerilla",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Guerilla",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d09fa4c0-7c31-3809-ac7c-59465bff3cc8",
                                        "entry_id": "f4db66f5-655b-3117-878f-0f2a444faa19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "durch irreguläre Einheiten der einheimischen Bevölkerung gegen eine Besatzungsmacht beziehungsweise im Rahmen eines Bürgerkriegs geführter Kleinkrieg"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6555b1f0-1783-4787-9b5c-7e86596d1ddc",
                                                "sense_id": "d09fa4c0-7c31-3809-ac7c-59465bff3cc8",
                                                "text": "„Und das, nachdem in Nicaragua 2006 wieder die Sandinisten an die Macht gekommen waren und in El Salvador im März 2009 mit Mauricio Funes ein Vertreter der ehemaligen Guerilla FMLN (Frente Farabundo Martí für die Nationale Befreiung) zum Präsidenten gewählt wurde.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca04144f-bc03-440e-9ba6-d4a7bd579850",
                                                "sense_id": "d09fa4c0-7c31-3809-ac7c-59465bff3cc8",
                                                "text": "Jeder hatte die Guerilla bereits für tot erklärt, als sie Anfang der 80er einen unerwarteten, neuen Aufschwung bekam."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f97af84-633e-4352-8b2b-b178ce2b53f6",
                                                "sense_id": "d09fa4c0-7c31-3809-ac7c-59465bff3cc8",
                                                "text": "„Einen Krieg dieser Art bezeichnete man als Guerilla und meinte mit dieser Bezeichnung auch seinen Begriff festgelegt zu haben.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09e22698-180d-324c-acbf-d70a7f59bda6",
                                        "entry_id": "f4db66f5-655b-3117-878f-0f2a444faa19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Einheit, die einen Kleinkrieg führt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15f8e538-d73c-4037-9495-6f56b1df678c",
                                                "sense_id": "09e22698-180d-324c-acbf-d70a7f59bda6",
                                                "text": "„Seit der Flugzeugträger \"USS Enterprise\" vor dem Persischen Golf steht, ist die Unruhe in der iranischen Regierung deutlich gewachsen. Das Schiff bildet die schwimmende Hintergrundkulisse zum Atomstreit. Doch die Revolutionswächter sind gewappnet: Sie haben eine Art Guerilla-Marine aufgebaut.[…]Die Revolutionswächter dagegen haben eine Art Guerilla-Marine aufgebaut, die äußerst mobil und nur schwer aufzuspüren ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "124bebff-54b8-4642-a248-48380ad30ac2",
                                                "sense_id": "09e22698-180d-324c-acbf-d70a7f59bda6",
                                                "text": "Die Guerilla hat in der Regel sehr gute Terrainkenntnisse."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Guerilla",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "affa52d1-b99a-3431-ac9d-7682aa4cd47e",
                                        "entry_id": "931547bc-acbe-38d3-bac6-1d28e664f060",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Angehöriger einer Einheit, die einen Kleinkrieg (siehe Guerilla^([2])) führt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "zumeist im Plural; veraltend"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9368df7-c95d-4730-9db1-694639eef1eb",
                                                "sense_id": "affa52d1-b99a-3431-ac9d-7682aa4cd47e",
                                                "text": "„Die Guerillas der PKK dagegen sind Freiwillige, die zumeist seit Jahren keine Verbindung mehr mit ihren Familien haben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62f9b70d-bd0e-4a05-8830-096b315b36e7",
                                                "sense_id": "affa52d1-b99a-3431-ac9d-7682aa4cd47e",
                                                "text": "„Da sie nicht preisgeben wollen, wo die besten Pilzfundorte sind, sickern sie einzeln wie Guerillas ein und stromern dann in großen Abständen umher.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7bd9fa3c-a554-4185-b06f-4aad070c6688",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd70e765-4815-326f-a164-b2dd5c58e39d",
                        "target_lang_word": "guerrilla",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "guerrilla",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "210e9677-5549-39c4-8472-8e1d47a34c83",
                                        "entry_id": "ea205b44-432f-3068-80fb-9ea0c2092b87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A soldier in a small independent group, fighting against the government or regular forces by surprise raids."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71876522-6558-47bb-ba80-d8565bd175e0",
                                                "sense_id": "210e9677-5549-39c4-8472-8e1d47a34c83",
                                                "text": "The right-wing paramilitary's offensive against the Marxist guerrillas failed because they did not know the terrain well enough."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "846727ec-a923-4e5b-a4e6-f9bb900d5e6d",
                                                "sense_id": "210e9677-5549-39c4-8472-8e1d47a34c83",
                                                "text": "From the start of its operations in Colombia, the company was on guard against the decadeslong civil strife in the country between left-wing guerrilla and right-wing paramilitary groups, witnesses have testified."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec121ecb-18e0-377e-8742-9922948243b1",
                                        "entry_id": "ea205b44-432f-3068-80fb-9ea0c2092b87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A non-official war carried out by small independent groups; a guerrilla war."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "939846ac-f10e-3daf-82fe-ff7193fcb369",
                                        "entry_id": "ea205b44-432f-3068-80fb-9ea0c2092b87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A marketer who uses guerrilla marketing techniques."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8af20039-f3bb-3575-8439-2139254220f6",
                                        "entry_id": "ea205b44-432f-3068-80fb-9ea0c2092b87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A maker of guerrilla television."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "guerrilla",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2be1b80-4862-327b-99f6-62e8bc347909",
                                        "entry_id": "42595c03-8645-309b-9823-ab0482e54bb3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to, using, or typical of guerrilla warfare, or its principles of small independent or non-official perpetrators."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd5c80a5-e874-4fb2-96d9-ff3b57517d1f",
                                                "sense_id": "f2be1b80-4862-327b-99f6-62e8bc347909",
                                                "text": "Wherever Nicholson was most wanted, there he was sure to be found. What his life was at this time may be seen from a letter he wrote to his mother: 'I am leading a very guerrilla sort of life with seven hundred horse and foot raised among the people of the country. The chieftain who is in rebellion has eight regular regiments and sixteen guns, so that I am unable to meet them openly in the field.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33fb87da-649d-48e1-be79-6488189476a5",
                                                "sense_id": "f2be1b80-4862-327b-99f6-62e8bc347909",
                                                "text": "On the other hand, after the fall of Feng Ling Tu, the operations of Central Shansi, and Suiyuan, troops were more guerrilla than orthodox in nature."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8d56717-03f9-4dfc-9c01-70e43a133e51",
                                                "sense_id": "f2be1b80-4862-327b-99f6-62e8bc347909",
                                                "text": "The Slovak uprising in the latter days was not guerrilla in character, which, incidentally, may have been one of the reasons for its failure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35dd337b-836c-3159-8988-1aff3da798bc",
                                        "entry_id": "42595c03-8645-309b-9823-ab0482e54bb3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to, using, or typical of guerrilla marketing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "866d684f-9891-48ef-81df-9b356b070e2a",
                                                "sense_id": "35dd337b-836c-3159-8988-1aff3da798bc",
                                                "text": "We took a very guerrilla approach to marketing Goin' Hollywood, in keeping with the irreverent tone of the game."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df0e284b-7c59-4bd2-b202-11bb77e49b25",
                                                "sense_id": "35dd337b-836c-3159-8988-1aff3da798bc",
                                                "text": "\"Mozilla's marketing has been very guerrilla. You're not seeing it spend millions of dollars on TV. Instead, it's a powerful ground swell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6f42651-18b6-4388-a3ff-771e3a70be9e",
                                                "sense_id": "35dd337b-836c-3159-8988-1aff3da798bc",
                                                "text": "My style is more guerrilla. I grew up in a village, a very suppressed environment. I was like one of those young kids who hated the whole conventional way of doing things. So when I started to make films it was very hand-made, very fast."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d97b8943-6812-3e70-a75e-bb7bc5139a81",
                                        "entry_id": "42595c03-8645-309b-9823-ab0482e54bb3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Using unconventional, non-traditional, non-mainstream and often subversive practices to achieve something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "721f88c8-711f-4174-b3be-24562ab3eddf",
                                                "sense_id": "d97b8943-6812-3e70-a75e-bb7bc5139a81",
                                                "text": "guerrilla marketing"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db4f3253-d8a8-4495-aa8c-c92f5d3c35ff",
                                                "sense_id": "d97b8943-6812-3e70-a75e-bb7bc5139a81",
                                                "text": "guerrilla tourism"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "626b09ab-856f-4d4b-ad1e-392fe05f87e2",
                                                "sense_id": "d97b8943-6812-3e70-a75e-bb7bc5139a81",
                                                "text": "guerrilla gardening"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d1747a3-d0cc-4676-93c3-68bc09e47eb5",
                                                "sense_id": "d97b8943-6812-3e70-a75e-bb7bc5139a81",
                                                "text": "The Boston demonstration, which will feature singing and guerrilla theatre, will begin at 12 noon in front of the Park Street Subway station."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "947bc78c-7975-4b77-9ba4-847a2a518f59",
                                                "sense_id": "d97b8943-6812-3e70-a75e-bb7bc5139a81",
                                                "text": "Jackass’s guerrilla, nonnarrative format"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d81b1242-2a79-4cb8-92f7-2545c91dcfd7",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd70e765-4815-326f-a164-b2dd5c58e39d",
                        "target_lang_word": "guérilla",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "guérilla",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bcc00ee-b91d-3f09-9a70-0443fde7b4f2",
                                        "entry_id": "684b3fe5-ed77-33f6-8185-2fd46f2fca01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Corps franc, bande de partisans."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "666a3821-7076-41ad-b162-796d490bd3b1",
                                                "sense_id": "5bcc00ee-b91d-3f09-9a70-0443fde7b4f2",
                                                "text": "Une guerre de guérilla."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79cd326e-60f4-45de-b51f-08de6e259f71",
                                                "sense_id": "5bcc00ee-b91d-3f09-9a70-0443fde7b4f2",
                                                "text": "Les guérillas du général von Wirtz quitteront la Courlande si l’Angleterre et la France refusent tout appui."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2c673ea-fa1b-39fb-86bf-eeb60a57c370",
                                        "entry_id": "684b3fe5-ed77-33f6-8185-2fd46f2fca01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Technique de combat de ces corps francs fait d’escarmouches et d’évitement d’engagements frontaux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcaaece6-24c9-4499-b8b5-b1de3bac9e4a",
                                                "sense_id": "f2c673ea-fa1b-39fb-86bf-eeb60a57c370",
                                                "text": "Autant qu'on pût le discerner à travers les nouvelles souvent contradictoires des deux camps, La tactique ennemie avec sa guérilla tenace, ses corps à corps sauvages neutralisaient momentanément la supériorité des chars d'assaut et des autos blindées."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9160ecd4-42a8-4110-b743-40091b152014",
                                                "sense_id": "f2c673ea-fa1b-39fb-86bf-eeb60a57c370",
                                                "text": "La victoire armée du peuple cubain sur la dictature de Batista […] a démontré de façon tangible que, par la guérilla, un peuple peut se libérer d'un gouvernement qui l’opprime."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f15e8406-a74e-474c-871d-23a417f81d58",
                                                "sense_id": "f2c673ea-fa1b-39fb-86bf-eeb60a57c370",
                                                "text": "Certaines embuscades étaient un défi à ce que doit être une action de guérilla convenablement menée : harceler, se retirer avant que l’adversaire ait eu le temps de réagir — et les Allemands, soldats professionnels, étaient incroyablement prompts, après leurs premières pertes, à occuper des positions d’où ils nous arrosaient à la mitrailleuse et au mortier —, avoir toujours des arrières où se replier."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4143fc3c-a6ea-36e4-be26-2dfc3a086e8c",
                                        "entry_id": "684b3fe5-ed77-33f6-8185-2fd46f2fca01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Film disposant de très peu de moyens financiers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1b87e82-df2d-4811-b1b7-ff8a1b7ff760",
                                                "sense_id": "4143fc3c-a6ea-36e4-be26-2dfc3a086e8c",
                                                "text": "S'il ne s’embarrassait de cet artifice mélodramatique, à travers la poussière vaudrait pour ce qu’il est : un film-guérilla tirant de son décor d’apocalypse, en plein cœur des combats, une forme particulièrement héroïque."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "42083ff4-6b35-465c-a9b5-c8a6016f260a",
